OL,3,AJapan Inc is betting big on India as
OL,4,AChina risks deepen
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndia's commerce minister Piyush Goyal
OL,7,Fled the country's largest-ever business
OL,8,Fdelegation to Japan last week in a bid
OL,9,Fto expand trade and investment ties
OL,10,Fbetween the two countries. His visit
OL,11,Fcame as Japan's deepening push into
OL,12,FAsia's third largest economy has become
OL,13,Fincreasingly more apparent.
OL,15,FIf you visit a shopping mall or a high
OL,16,Fstreet in Mumbai, Delhi or Bengaluru,
OL,17,Fit's hard to miss the growing number of
OL,18,FJapanese consumer brands that have set
OL,19,Fup shop across India.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
