OL,3,AJapan Inc is betting big on India as
OL,4,AChina risks deepen
OL,5,
OL,6,FApparel giants Uniqlo and Muji and
OL,7,Fpremium sneakers company Onitsuka Tiger
OL,8,Fhave been around for a while, but are
OL,9,Frapidly expanding.
OL,11,FNiche players are also here - Nitori, a
OL,12,FJapanese furniture maker, entered the
OL,13,Fmarket recently, while convenience
OL,14,Fstore chain Lawson is on its way, with
OL,15,Fa plan to reportedly open 10,000 stores
OL,16,Fby 2050 in India, starting with Mumbai.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
